title Vinyl P2a: a notice over a Menu page (a 15-minute timer with 2 s left ends while the Sleep timer page shows: "Sleep timer ended. Paused." over the page's bottom, the timer back to Off) (the qa sizes and 1280x720)
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640 1280x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE sleep
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP 15
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP_LEFT 2

wait 600
shot 01-sleep-running
expect text "STOP PLAYING AFTER"
wait 2600
shot 02-sleep-ended
expect text "Sleep timer ended. Paused."
expect text "STOP PLAYING AFTER"
expect noquit
